OL,3,GNEWSANew orchard where residents can   
OL,4,Apick fruit                             
OL,6,FResidents will soon be able to pick    
OL,7,Ffree apples and pears from a new       
OL,8,Fcommunity orchard being planted in one 
OL,9,Fof Leicester's biggest parks.          
OL,11,FA total of 24 fruit trees will be      
OL,12,Fplanted in Braunstone Park on Friday by
OL,13,Fvolunteer tree wardens and members of  
OL,14,Fthe Leicester Environmental Volunteers'
OL,15,Fgroup as part of National Tree Week.   
OL,17,FThe new orchard will become one of more
OL,18,Fthan 20 community orchards across the  
OL,19,Fcity, giving people in the area free   
OL,20,Faccess to fruit and nuts including     
OL,21,Fplums, cherries, damsons and hazelnuts.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
